  "description": "This proposal is for the replacement of the current concrete tiled roof with a slate tile replacement as recommended in the Rectory Fields Conservation Area Document (May 1996) and required under an Article 4 direction relating to roofing.  Daylight can be seen via our loft space and after having it inspected by roofers for repair, it was noted that our current roof is between 40-50 years old and nearing the end of its life. We proposed to replace the roof with slate tiling, install new high-performance breathable underlay, install new ridge tiles using a \"dry ridge\" system and to replace all lead flashings around the chimney stack. \n ",
